emanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeThemeBarComponentTokensProvider"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"title":"Theme Orange","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","images":[{"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","type":"icon"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example.","type":"text"}]}}}